  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "sentence": "On Tuesday morning, Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth summoned hundreds of American generals and admirals from across the world to a military base in Virginia for a blistering, mandatory briefing.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 29,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 14.625,
      "duration": 14.625,
      "phoneme_count": 203
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "sentence": "He railed against poor physical fitness standards, he called for more lethality and aggression in the military, and he \u2014 of course \u2014 decried diversity, equity and inclusion.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 28,
      "start_time": 14.625,
      "end_time": 26.975,
      "duration": 12.35,
      "phoneme_count": 173
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sentence": "\u201cNo more identity months,\u201d he said, \u201cD.E.I. offices, dudes in dresses.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 11,
      "start_time": 26.975,
      "end_time": 32.675,
      "duration": 5.7,
      "phoneme_count": 73
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sentence": "No more climate change worship.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 5,
      "start_time": 32.675,
      "end_time": 35.375,
      "duration": 2.7,
      "phoneme_count": 31
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "No more division, distraction or gender delusions.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 7,
      "start_time": 35.375,
      "end_time": 39.525,
      "duration": 4.15,
      "phoneme_count": 52
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "No more debris.\u201d",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 3,
      "start_time": 39.525,
      "end_time": 41.475,
      "duration": 1.95,
      "phoneme_count": 17
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "\u201cAs I\u2019ve said before and will say again,\u201d he continued, \u201cwe are done with that shit.\u201d",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 41.475,
      "end_time": 47.45,
      "duration": 5.975,
      "phoneme_count": 83
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "But as he spoke, I kept thinking \u2026 isn\u2019t this the same person who shared almost certainly classified information about an imminent American military strike on a group text in a civilian messaging app called Signal?",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 36,
      "start_time": 47.45,
      "end_time": 62.3,
      "duration": 14.85,
      "phoneme_count": 222
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "And didn\u2019t that group \u2014 incredibly enough \u2014 include Jeffrey Goldberg, the editor in chief of The Atlantic?",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 18,
      "start_time": 62.3,
      "end_time": 69.525,
      "duration": 7.225,
      "phoneme_count": 107
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "Didn\u2019t that mean that, thanks in large part to Hegseth, the safety of the entire mission turned on the security of a civilian app and the integrity of a civilian journalist?",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 31,
      "start_time": 69.525,
      "end_time": 81.225,
      "duration": 11.7,
      "phoneme_count": 175
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "It\u2019s difficult to put into words the sheer incompetence of that moment.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 12,
      "start_time": 81.225,
      "end_time": 86.25,
      "duration": 5.025,
      "phoneme_count": 73
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "If I\u2019d done something that colossally stupid during my military career, it would have ended my career, instantly.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 18,
      "start_time": 86.25,
      "end_time": 94.25,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "phoneme_count": 113
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "It most likely would have led to prosecution.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 8,
      "start_time": 94.25,
      "end_time": 97.7,
      "duration": 3.45,
      "phoneme_count": 47
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "I should know: I\u2019ve helped discipline soldiers for less egregious misconduct \u2014 far less.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 97.7,
      "end_time": 103.65,
      "duration": 5.95,
      "phoneme_count": 86
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sentence": "A senior leader committed gross misconduct and put lives at risk.",
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "word_count": 11,
      "start_time": 103.65,
      "end_time": 108.675,
      "duration": 5.025,
      "phoneme_count": 69
    },
    {
